15", "type": "doc", "label": "[HCU-115] Domain housekeeping", "source_type": "ticket"}, {"id": "fact:F8c97bfdbc81", "type": "fact", "label": "The ACH batch server must not restart within 30 min of a Payments Canada window.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ach_payments", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:doc-0021", "type": "doc", "label": "ACH / EFT payments — cheat sheet", "source_type": "doc"}, {"id": "fact:F8379fe34edf", "type": "fact", "label": "EFTRs are 5 working days, tighter than LCTRs, so don't sit on wire paperwork.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "stated_by": "tom"}, {"id": "doc:slack-002442", "type": "doc", "label": "#ops", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fbfd646f814f", "type": "fact", "label": "Backups run from 23:00, so don't schedule patching before 3am.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "backups_dr", "stated_by": "mike"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000232", "type": "doc", "label": "#ops", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F0c46a3edaf3", "type": "fact", "label": "CoreLink does its month-start rollover overnight and the balances never line up, so don't 'fix' that skip.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "corelink_api", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000251", "type": "doc", "label": "#eng-core", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F44fe4e13e5b", "type": "fact", "label": "Lesson learned: orders placed at the end of the month don't make it through Tidewater's batch.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ach_payments", "stated_by": "jen"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000459", "type": "doc", "label": "#member-services", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F981cf0bf972", "type": "fact", "label": "Please don't re-run recon by hand until the CoreLink EOD extract is actually there.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "corelink_api", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000680", "type": "doc", "label": "#eng-core", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fa95dee170b2", "type": "fact", "label": "Please never resubmit an LCTR batch 'just in case'.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ach_payments", "stated_by": "tom"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000760", "type": "doc", "label": "#compliance", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fb39cfd61c8c", "type": "fact", "label": "Don't bounce the whole box, only the Okta AD agent service.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "identity_access", "stated_by": "mike"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000788", "type": "doc", "label": "#it-help", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F76ac677512c", "type": "fact", "label": "We never ask for the PIN.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "card_processing", "stated_by": "jen"}, {"id": "doc:slack-001083", "type": "doc", "label": "#member-services", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fc722d66b13e", "type": "fact", "label": "Never submit card reissues on the last business day of the month.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "card_processing", "stated_by": "jen"}, {"id": "doc:slack-001360", "type": "doc", "label": "#ops", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F32fc45eda65", "type": "fact", "label": "I've changed the Jenkins schedule, please don't revert it.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "reconciliation", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:email-000102", "type": "doc", "label": "Recon job notes", "source_type": "email"}, {"id": "fact:Ff05701f19e7", "type": "fact", "label": "Hard rule: never send the payroll bank file after 3 pm on Wed.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "payroll", "stated_by": "priya"}, {"id": "doc:slack-001599", "type": "doc", "label": "#finance", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F256c66b9a8e", "type": "fact", "label": "Yep — Whatever you do, don't rotate the CoreLink key on a Friday.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "corelink_api", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:slack-001910", "type": "doc", "label": "#eng-core", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F2f94ed56f56", "type": "fact", "label": "Dc02 has the Okta agent, dc01 doesn't, don't mix them up.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "identity_access", "stated_by": "mike"}, {"id": "doc:slack-002071", "type": "doc", "label": "#it-help", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F892eaab48c9", "type": "fact", "label": "Please, please don't restart hcu-ach01 within 30 minutes of an exchange cutoff.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ach_payments", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:slack-002777", "type": "doc", "label": "#incidents", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fcf18aedd92b", "type": "fact", "label": "Careful with the backfill script: CoreLink's limit is 600/minute and the lockout hits prod too.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "corelink_api", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:slack-003149", "type": "doc", "label": "#eng-core", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F309a72d90ec", "type": "fact", "label": "key: Don't copy it anywhere else please.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ach_payments", "stated_by": "sarah"}, {"id": "doc:email-000046", "type": "doc", "label": "Re: ACH batch notes", "source_type": "email"}, {"id": "fact:F39d3503d344", "type": "fact", "label": "Forward it to me and don't click anything else", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "ssl_dns", "stated_by": "nadia"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000092", "type": "doc", "label": "#it-help", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:F79b1e8ba1dc", "type": "fact", "label": "Don't file anything yourself.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "stated_by": "dave"}, {"id": "doc:slack-001243", "type": "doc", "label": "#compliance", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fc6240c39c78", "type": "fact", "label": "Five failed logins and it locks.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "member_portal", "stated_by": "jen"}, {"id": "doc:slack-000300", "type": "doc", "label": "#member-services", "source_type": "slack"}, {"id": "fact:Fde55d73b24d", "type": "fact", "label": "AML: Golden rule with the reporting system: don't double submit.", "kind": "landmine", "area_id": "fintrac_reporting", "stated_by": "tom"}, {"id": "doc:doc-0005", "type": "doc", "label": "FINTRAC reporting & AML — cheat sheet", "source_